% This t-SNE figures illustrate how the semantic context of a query term evolves, showing whether terms remain semantically similar or diverge significantly over time.
% 
Through these analyses, we aim to provide a comprehensive view of the temporal evolution of language and themes in literary texts, highlighting some valuable insights into how the concepts have evolved, across different historical decades in the collection.

