\label{sec:method}

The proposed framework adopts hierarchical architecture design, achieving precise tumor segmentation through collaborative operation of MSFA and BIVA. As shown in Figure~\ref{fig:framework}, the framework accepts multi-sequence MRI images and clinical descriptions, performs multi-modal feature extraction through MSFA, achieves dynamic interaction optimization through BIVA, and outputs segmentation results through 3D decoder.

