To illustrate how EvoSort adapts to a specific dataset size, consider the case of sorting 10 million (\(10^7\)) elements. Figure~\ref{fig:ga_10M} (left) depicts the Genetic Algorithm’s convergence over 10 generations, with three key performance indicators for each generation:

