    \item \textbf{Minimal Execution Time:} The best individual consistently shows a sorting time of about 0.2416\,s, which the GA identifies and preserves via elitism. Minor fluctuations in later generations (e.g., 0.2659\,s, 0.2719\,s) arise from exploring slight parameter variations, but these do not outperform the 0.2416\,s record.
\end{itemize}

\noindent
By the final generation (Generation~10), the GA confirms that no further improvements are found and that 0.2416\,s is effectively the best possible time for this dataset. The corresponding “best individual” from the GA is:
\[
