        Y_0 = (\{\alpha\beta,\alpha^2\beta\}\times [b]_X) \cup (\{0\}\times X),\qquad Y_1 = (\{\alpha\beta,\alpha^2\beta\}\times [a]_X) \cup (\{\alpha,\alpha^2\}\times X).
